-   detail
+   detail

-       `Person is Resolvable by Text` says that a `Text` key identifies a `Person`, which
-       field of `Person` is that key (`#field`), and how a key is resolved (`#resolve`). The
-       `ref` extension and `Reference#apply` both need one in scope.
+       `Person is Resolvable by Text` dice que una clave `Text` identifica a un `Person`, qué
+       campo de `Person` es esa clave (`#field`) y cómo se resuelve una clave (`#resolve`). Tanto
+       la extensión `ref` como `Reference#apply` necesitan una en el ámbito.

